 <div class="container bottom"><small>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Self Defense Sondrio ASD</small><div class="legal"><a href="/privacy">Privacy</a><a href="/cookie-policy">Cookie Policy</a><button type="button" data-cookie-review>Rivedi preferenze cookie</button></div></div>
